# Supabase CLI working state — link metadata, pulled schemas, container state.
# `.temp/` in particular holds the project ref and pooler URLs of whatever
# project was last linked, which is exactly the kind of thing that should never
# be committed from a machine that has linked to production.
.branches/
.temp/

# Edge Function secrets. The example file next to it is committed; these are not.
functions/.env
functions/.env.local
